WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.918 --> 00:00:03.003
(soaring music)

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:06.798
- I know I'm not an
ordinary 10-year-old kid.

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:10.302
Then again, 
no one's ordinary.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:13.222
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:15.766
- Auggie can't change 
the way he looks.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:18.602
So maybe we can change 
the way we see.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.272
(bird wings fluttering)

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.608
- Tell me about 
this new school of yours.

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:26.276
- Right now, 
I'm just trying to fit in.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.403
It's kind of been my motto ever
since I left my old school.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.531
- Julian, you did not
leave your old school.

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:34.117
You were expelled for
being cruel to another boy.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.579
(uplifting music)

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:39.456
I'm sure your father 
has told you stories

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.500
about when I was a young girl.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.168
- He says you don't really
like to talk about it.

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:47.339
- I don't, but now I think,
for your sake, I must.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:52.427
(otherworldly music)

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:53.637
- Excuse me.

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.138
- Oh God, what is he doing?

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:57.808
- I saw this on your desk.
- Thanks.

00:00:57.808 --> 00:00:58.809
- You're welcome.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.687
- I didn't even know his name,
(children laughing)

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:04.731
but we had in common 
one crucial thing.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.941
- These are really good,

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:09.653
for a Jew.
(dramatic music)

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:13.699
- We had both seen how much
hate people are capable of,

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:15.158
(music flourishes)

00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:18.120
and how much courage it took, 
to be kind.

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:23.667
- Find them!

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.544
- You need to come 
with me right now.

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:28.630
I know a way out.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:33.427
In dark times, small things
remind us of our humanity.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:35.512
(film projector whirring)

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:37.556
How would you like to
visit New York tonight?

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:38.932
- Sure.

00:01:39.183 --> 00:01:41.977
- [Julien] Open your eyes.
(soaring music)

00:01:44.855 --> 00:01:46.773
- World of reality 
has its limits.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:50.194
The world of imagination 
is boundless.

00:01:50.194 --> 00:01:52.196
(soaring music)

00:01:52.196 --> 00:01:54.656
You're the bravest person 
I've ever met.

00:01:54.656 --> 00:01:55.699
(bats shrieking)

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.582
- You forget many things 
in life,

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.627
but you never forget kindness.

00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:15.677
Like love, 
it stays with you forever.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.597
(music flourishes)

